{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1120620001:0":{"text":"ここの景色は本当に美しい。特に日没の時間が。我々の故郷では見られない景色です。","source_cn":"这里的风景可真壮美，尤其是落日时分。我们的家乡是见不到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694B6A7BAEADDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120620002:0":{"text":"「砂漠の夕日を見つめるハンター・セレックの胸に突然ある衝動が湧きあがった」","source_cn":"“猎手塞雷克看着荒漠的落日，心里突然涌起了一阵冲动”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DA01F87B7F3D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120620003:0":{"text":"「セレックは馬を走らせた。太陽の日差しよりも黄砂よりも速く！そしてさきほど銃声が響いた時刻へと戻ってきた――」","source_cn":"“他要策马奔驰，跑得比骄阳与黄沙更快，重新回到枪声刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD9DCC27DD8F17A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120620004:0":{"text":"アウェン、また始まった……","source_cn":"艾文，你又开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05AC7792443D5241","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:宝藏猎人欧迪尔":{"text":"ハンターのオーディア","source":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宝藏猎人艾文":{"text":"ハンターのアウェン","source":"宝藏猎人艾文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}